VLOW_DRIFT_X      0.1 ; km/h ! [D] Low speed limit: allow near-static Fx to avoid
                      ! drift when stopped on a grade [I]
VLOW_DRIFT_Y      0.1 ; km/h ! [D] Low speed limit: allow near-static Fy to avoid
